# 统一仓库内文本文件为 LF，检出时也保持 LF（跨平台一致，由本文件决定行尾，
# 不再依赖各机器的 core.autocrlf 设置）。需要 CRLF 的特例显式列出。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析可能出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件，禁止任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.tar binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.lib binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.aar binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.p12 binary
*.pfx binary
*.db binary
